{"file":"Lightrun-0.1.0-v2.zip","bytes":98659,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"lightrun-ai","description":"Lightrun runtime investigation skills for deterministic, evidence-first debugging.","version":"0.1.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/lightrun-platform/lightrun-ai","homepage":"https://github.com/lightrun-platform/lightrun-ai","keywords":["lightrun","runtime-debugging","skills","observability"]},{"path":".cursor-plugin/plugin.json","name":"lightrun-ai","description":"Lightrun live-runtime debugging skills with deterministic preflight and evidence-first diagnosis.","version":"0.1.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/lightrun-platform/lightrun-ai","homepage":"https://github.com/lightrun-platform/lightrun-ai","keywords":["lightrun","runtime-debugging","skills","observability"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/lightrun-ask-prod/SKILL.md","name":"lightrun-ask-prod","description":"Answer questions about live production system behavior — current variable values, execution durations, hit counts, and value distributions — by instrumenting running services with Lightrun MCP tools. Use when the question requires live runtime data rather than static code analysis (e.g. \"show recent requests to this endpoint\", \"show the runtime distribution for this operation\", \"what values appear for this expression in production?\", \"which branch runs for customer X?\"). Do not use for incident diagnosis, pull-request review, code changes, setup, or deployment. Route latency, timeout, deadline, SLO, or hang diagnosis to lightrun-slow-execution-diagnosis when available; route other diagnosis, or fallback when that skill is unavailable, to lightrun-live-runtime-debugging when available. If neither diagnosis skill is available, report the scope gap.","headings":["Usage telemetry","Ask Prod","MCP Tool Discovery","Prerequisites","Flow","1. Understand the question","2. Identify the right capability","3. Locate the relevant code","4. Select the agent pool and agents","5. Collect runtime data","6. Analyse and answer","Error Handling","Schema-Driven Example"],"name_hint":"lightrun · ask · prod","description_zh":"通过Lightrun MCP对运行服务设置观测，查询生产变量、时长、命中次数和分布；性能故障转slow-execution，其他诊断转live-runtime，不用于PR、改码、设置或部署。"},{"path":"skills/lightrun-error-remediation-automation/SKILL.md","name":"lightrun-error-remediation-automation","description":"Guide deterministic runtime investigations in environments using Lightrun MCP tools, with preflight gating, recovery/resume rules, evidence-first diagnosis, PR-first fix proposal delivery, and local source-code fallback only when PR creation is not possible.","headings":["Usage Tracking Preflight","Goal","Scope","Preconditions","State persistence tool discovery","Automation and portability","MCP Tool Discovery","MCP Preflight","Resume Criteria","Runtime Tool Selection Strategy","Source Selection Confidence","Investigation Principles","Tool Call Timing","Mandatory Runtime Action Result Gate","Runtime Action Cleanup","Action Error Mitigation","Bug Explanation and Fix Proposal Standard","Fix Proposal Delivery Policy"],"name_hint":"lightrun · error · remediation · automation","description_zh":"通过Lightrun MCP组织确定性的运行时调查，涵盖前置关卡、恢复规则、证据优先诊断和优先PR交付修复建议，仅无法创建PR时回退本地源码。"},{"path":"skills/lightrun-live-runtime-debugging/SKILL.md","name":"lightrun-live-runtime-debugging","description":"Diagnose live bugs and incidents that require runtime evidence from a running service using Lightrun MCP. Use when static analysis or logs cannot explain the failure mechanism, when a hypothesis must be tested against live values or control flow, or when resuming Lightrun async actions. For latency, timeout, deadline, SLO, or hang diagnosis, use lightrun-slow-execution-diagnosis when available; if unavailable, continue here with best-effort evidence. Do not use for one-off production measurements (use lightrun-ask-prod when available; otherwise report the measurement-scope gap), pull-request review, code changes, setup, or deployment.","headings":["Usage telemetry","Goal","Scope","Runtime Preflight","Async Activation","Async Runtime Actions","Runtime Action Cleanup","Investigation Efficiency","Action Error Mitigation","Bug Explanation and Fix Proposal Standard","Quick Use Guide","Return One Outcome","Blocked","Reproduction Required","Inconclusive","Diagnosed"],"name_hint":"lightrun · live · runtime · debugging","description_zh":"通过Lightrun MCP诊断需实时服务证据的缺陷事故，验证值与控制流假设并恢复异步动作；性能问题优先slow-execution，不用于单次测量、PR审查、改码设置部署。"},{"path":"skills/lightrun-runtime-aware-pr-review/SKILL.md","name":"lightrun-runtime-aware-pr-review","description":"Use when reviewing a pull request with runtime or production evidence — for example to review a PR with runtime verification, gather production evidence, or simulate a patch on live samples. Reviews a pull request by diffing against the PR merge base, collecting live samples, and simulating the patch on captured production inputs.","headings":["Usage telemetry","Goal","Scope","How To Use This Skill","Checkpoints","Working Rules","Deliverable"],"name_hint":"lightrun · runtime · aware · pr · 评审","description_zh":"基于PR合并基线比较差异、采集实时生产样本并在捕获输入上模拟补丁，为PR提供运行时验证证据。"},{"path":"skills/lightrun-slow-execution-diagnosis/SKILL.md","name":"lightrun-slow-execution-diagnosis","description":"Diagnose performance incidents in running services with Lightrun MCP: slow endpoints, latency or SLO regressions, timeouts, deadline-exceeded errors, hangs, and slowness that is intermittent, sporadic, occasional, happens only sometimes, or appears only under load. Use when diagnosing a performance incident; prefer this over lightrun-live-runtime-debugging, including for mixed slow-and-incorrect cases. Use slow-execution snapshots when a duration boundary separates problematic executions; use focused active-path snapshots or call stacks for known hangs that may not reach an end marker. Select the narrowest code section, derive an evidence-based threshold, and correlate captured state with code and telemetry. Use lightrun-live-runtime-debugging for non-performance diagnosis and lightrun-ask-prod for one-off timing, when available; otherwise report the scope gap. Do not use for pull-request review, code changes, setup, deployment, or post-deployment performance validation.","headings":["Usage telemetry","Activation gate","Preflight","Choose the evidence path","Select the target and context","Runtime support","Capture and correlate","Return one outcome"],"name_hint":"lightrun · slow · execution · diagnosis","description_zh":"通过Lightrun MCP诊断慢端点、延迟SLO回归、超时、挂起和偶发负载问题，选择最窄代码区及有依据阈值，用慢执行或活动路径快照关联状态代码遥测；不用于部署后性能验收。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["Lightrun AI","What is in this repository","Available skills","Demos","Installation","Cursor","Claude","Codex","Requirements","Contributing"]},{"path":"lightrun-mcp-server/README.md","headings":["Lightrun MCP Server","What is Lightrun MCP?","MCP server URL","MCP configuration filenames","Registry metadata","Requirements","Authentication","Example prompts","Supported clients and frameworks","Documentation","Security","Support","License"]}],"mcp_servers":["Lightrun"],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/marketplace.json",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".cursor-plugin/marketplace.json",".cursor-plugin/plugin.json",".cursor/mcp.json","README.md","lightrun-mcp-server/LICENSE","lightrun-mcp-server/README.md","lightrun-mcp-server/SUBMISSION.md","lightrun-mcp-server/examples/claude-code.md","lightrun-mcp-server/examples/copilot-vscode-mcp.json","lightrun-mcp-server/examples/cursor-mcp.json","lightrun-mcp-server/examples/openai-agents.md","server.json","skills/lightrun-ask-prod/SKILL.md","skills/lightrun-ask-prod/references/mcp-tool-discovery.md","skills/lightrun-error-remediation-automation/SKILL.md","skills/lightrun-error-remediation-automation/agents/openai.yaml","skills/lightrun-error-remediation-automation/assets/lightrun-small.svg","skills/lightrun-erro